<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 255.68).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 255.68).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $0-1/2 to $56-1/2 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 255.68 markka. In Helsinki on Monday Nokia A closed down 1.00 markka at 255.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/4 at $32-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.97 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.40 markka at 73.40.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18-3/4 in New York on Monday. The price equals about 84.85 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 0.50 markka at 87.00.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
